events.raw:
{
  "understanding": "Kestrel Genetic Medicine, a private health-care provider established in Subregion A1, will make a one-off encrypted upload from A1 to Harrow Inherited Cardiac Clinic in Region B. The material is identified information about one adult A1 resident: name, date of birth, clinic reference number, a diagnostic genetic-test report, ECG summary, and referral letter. Harrow will review it for a treatment-related second opinion, conduct one video consultation, and retain the referral in its own clinical record in B. The patient specifically consented to the transfer after being informed that no recognition or safeguards would apply; no transfer-clause agreement or impact assessment exists, and no onward transfer is proposed.",
  "engagements": [
    {
      "corpus": "region_a",
      "engaged": true,
      "reason": "The sender is established in Subregion A1, the patient and data subject are an adult resident of A1, the information is stored and accessed in A1, and the proposed transfer is from A1 outside Region A. The case therefore falls within Region A territorial and outward-transfer issues, with possible subregion-specific health-information issues reachable by delegation.",
      "facts": [
